### 1. Create a Single Subject (School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
  "name": "Mathematics Activities",
  "code": "MATH-01",
  "category": "Core"
}

### 2. Bulk Create Subjects (School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/bulk
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "subjects": [
    {
      "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
      "name": "English Language",
      "code": "ENG-01",
      "category": "Core"
    },
    {
      "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
      "name": "Kiswahili Lugha",
      "code": "KIS-01",
      "category": "Core"
    },
    {
      "schoolId": "{{schoolId}}",
      "name": "Computer Science",
      "code": "CS-01",
      "category": "Technical"
    }
  ]
}

### 3. List Subjects by School with Category Filter (Authenticated Parent/Student or Admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/school/{{schoolId}}?category=Core
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{parentOrStudentToken}}

### 4. List Subjects by Teacher ID (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/teacher/{{teacherId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 5. Get Subject by ID (Authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{subjectId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{parentOrStudentToken}}

### 6. Update Subject Details (School Admin)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{subjectId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "name": "Advanced Mathematics",
  "category": "Core"
}

### 7. Assign Teacher to Subject (School Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{subjectId}}/teachers
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

{
  "teacherId": "{{teacherId}}"
}

### 8. Remove Teacher from Subject (School Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{subjectId}}/teachers/{{teacherId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}

### 9. Delete Subject (School Admin)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{subjectId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{schoolAdminToken}}